Steps of the shortest chain for 15: x^2 = x^1 x^1;  x^4 = x^2 x^2;  x^5 = x^4 x^1;  x^10 = x^5 x^5;  x^15 = x^10 x^5;  

3^15 mod 1000003: chain 348865, mod_pow 348865
